  "html": "<section class=\"container section--services-hero pt-5\">\n\t<div class=\"section--services-hero__main\">\n\t\t<div class=\"section--services-hero__main__row\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"section--services-hero__main__row__left\">\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group flow has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-group h-align icon-plus-title is-layout-flex wp-block-group-is-layout-flex\">    <div class=\"iconblock wp-elements-1 has-background has-secondary-background-color has-text-color has-secondary-inverse-color\" data-size=\"md\" data-padding=\"2\" data-display=\"inline\">\n        <svg class=\"icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-plumbing\" /></svg>    </div>\n\n<h1 class=\"has-link-color wp-elements-2 wp-block-post-title has-text-color has-secondary-color has-x-large-font-size\">Repiping in Columbia, SC</h1></div>\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group services-hero-description flow is-layout-flow wp-block-group-is-layout-flow\">\n<p>Repiping is the decision a house forces when its pipe material, not one bad joint, is the problem. 2nd Wind Heating &amp; Air Conditioning repipes homes in Columbia, SC and across the Midlands, replacing failing supply systems with modern piping, and the recommendation always comes with evidence: the corroded or failing sections shown to you, because a whole-home repipe should never be sold on assertion.</p>\n<p>Two materials drive most repipes in this market. Galvanized steel, standard in Columbia&#8217;s early and mid-1900s neighborhoods, corrodes from the inside for decades until the flow narrows, the water runs discolored, and pinholes open faster than they can be patched. Polybutylene, the gray plastic installed widely from the late 1970s to the mid 1990s, degrades chemically and fails at fittings without warning, which is why it became the subject of national class action litigation and why insurers still ask about it. A house with either material is not wondering whether failures are coming, only when.</p>\n<p>Schedule an evaluation with 2nd Wind by phone, online, or 24/7 chat, and see the actual condition of your system before deciding what it needs.</p>\n\n</div>\n\n<div  class=\"wp-block-group mb-3 full-width-mobile schedule-and-call-cta is-content-justification-left is-nowrap is-layout-flex wp-container-core-group-is-layout-a1b15d37 wp-block-group-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-group schedule-cta-container is-vertical is-content-justification-stretch is-layout-flex wp-container-core-group-is-layout-41171c72 wp-block-group-is-layout-flex\">\n<a href=\"/bookings\" data-cta-gap=\"md\" data-cta-type=\"solid\" data-cta-content=\"mixed\" data-cta-level=\"primary\" data-cta-minwidth=\"true\" class=\"cta se-widget-button\">\n    <svg class=\"icon cta-icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-event\" /></svg><span >Schedule Now</span>\n\n</a>\n\n    <p class=\"horizon-text has-secondary-font-family wp-block-paragraph\" style=\"text-transform:uppercase\">or speak with an expert!</p>\n\n<a href=\"tel:+18033921513\" aria-label=\"Call now: +18033921513\" data-cta-gap=\"md\" data-cta-type=\"solid\" data-cta-content=\"mixed\" data-cta-level=\"primary\" data-cta-minwidth=\"true\" class=\"cta phone-link\">\n    <svg class=\"icon cta-icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-phone\" /></svg><span data-show-on=\"desktop\">(803) 392-1513</span>\n        <span data-show-on=\"mobile\">Call Now</span>\n</a>\n\n<p class=\"has--color has-text-color has-link-color has-secondary-font-family has-small-font-size text-center wp-elements-3 wp-block-paragraph\" style=\"text-transform:uppercase\"><strong>Same Day Appointments Available by Phone</strong></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div><!-- ./left -->\n\t\t\t<div class=\"section--services-hero__main__row__right\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elevated content-fullbleed-mobile box-shadow-lg border-radius-lg\" >\n    <div class=\"acf-innerblocks-container\">\n\t\t\t<figure class=\"wp-block-post-featured-image\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"900\" height=\"506\" src=\"/images/2024/11/featured-image-plumbing-2ndwind-hvac-services-brown-friday.webp\" class=\"attachment-post-thumbnail size-post-thumbnail wp-post-image\" alt=\"Picture of a sink leaking heavily in a customer&#039;s house in Columbia, SC\" style=\"object-fit:cover;\" srcset=\"/images/2024/11/featured-image-plumbing-2ndwind-hvac-services-brown-friday.webp 900w, /images/2024/11/featured-image-plumbing-2ndwind-hvac-services-brown-friday-300x169.webp 300w, /images/2024/11/featured-image-plumbing-2ndwind-hvac-services-brown-friday-768x432.webp 768w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1010px) 100vw, (max-width: 1440px) 50vw, 768px\" /></figure>\n\t\t\t</div>\n</div>\t\t\t</div><!-- ./right -->\n\t\t</div><!-- ./row -->\n\n</div>\n\t<div class=\"section--services-hero__main section--services-hero__main--empty has-background has-secondary-background-color\"></div>\n\n</section>\n<!-- container /--><div id=\"types-of-services\" class=\"types-of-service-container container py-5 wp-elements-4 has-custom-acf-color has-background has-secondary-background-color has-text-color has-primary-inverse-color\"><!-- wp-block-columns/ -->\n        <div data-num-of-columns=\"3\" class=\"wp-block-columns mb-4 is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-layout-1 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\">\n    <!-- column/ -->\n        <div class=\"wp-block-column flow is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n            <div class=\"types-of-service__icon-title\">\n                    <div class=\"iconblock\" data-size=\"lg\" data-padding=\"0\" data-display=\"block\">\n        <svg class=\"icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-toolbox\" /></svg>    </div>\n                                        <h2 class=\"h3 text-left mt-0 font-size-5\">When Repiping Beats Repair</h2>\n                                    </div>\n                            <p class=\"FirstParagraph\">The math turns when failures stop being isolated. Recurring pinholes, chronically weak flow at multiple fixtures, rusty water from the cold tap, and repair bills arriving in a pattern all say the system is failing as a system. At that point, each spot repair buys months, while a repipe retires the risk entirely. We lay out both numbers, the repair pattern you are on and the repipe cost, and the decision stays yours.</p>\n                            </div><!-- ./column -->\n        <!-- column/ -->\n        <div class=\"wp-block-column flow is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n            <div class=\"types-of-service__icon-title\">\n                    <div class=\"iconblock\" data-size=\"lg\" data-padding=\"0\" data-display=\"block\">\n        <svg class=\"icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-technician\" /></svg>    </div>\n                                        <h2 class=\"h3 text-left mt-0 font-size-5\">How a Repipe Proceeds</h2>\n                                    </div>\n                            <p class=\"FirstParagraph\">A repipe replaces the supply lines from the main connection to every fixture. The work is planned before it is started: pipe runs mapped, wall and ceiling openings minimized and marked, and water downtime scheduled in defined windows so the household is not dry for days. New lines are pressure tested before walls close, and the openings are documented for the drywall repair that follows. Materials are matched to the house and the water: PEX routes flexibly through existing framing with fewer joints, and copper remains available where preferred.</p>\n                            </div><!-- ./column -->\n        <!-- column/ -->\n        <div class=\"wp-block-column flow is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n            <div class=\"types-of-service__icon-title\">\n                    <div class=\"iconblock\" data-size=\"lg\" data-padding=\"0\" data-display=\"block\">\n        <svg class=\"icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-technician-gears\" /></svg>    </div>\n                                        <h2 class=\"h3 text-left mt-0 font-size-5\">Additional Services</h2>\n                                    </div>\n                            <p>Pressure problems are measured through a <a href=\"/services/plumbing-columbia-sc/water-pressure-assessments\">water pressure assessment</a> and corrected at the regulator, freeze-exposed runs are rerouted or insulated rather than copied, a concern our <a href=\"/services/plumbing-columbia-sc/frozen-burst-pipe-repair\">frozen and burst pipe repair</a> team sees the results of every winter, and mineral-heavy well water gets addressed through our <a href=\"/services/plumbing-columbia-sc/water-softeners\">water softener services</a> so the new pipes stay clean inside. Isolated failures that do not justify a repipe are handled through our <a href=\"/services/plumbing-columbia-sc/pipes-and-general-plumbing\">pipe repair and general plumbing services</a>.</p>\n                            </div><!-- ./column -->\n        </div><!-- ./ wp-block-columns --> </div><!-- ./container -->\n<div class=\"our-promise container \" id=\"our-promise\">\n<div class=\"elevated content-fullbleed-mobile box-shadow-lg border-radius-lg\">\n\n<figure class=\"our-promise__photo\">\n<img decoding=\"async\" width=\"640\" height=\"428\" src=\"/images/2024/03/A-Carolina-Heating-Service-underneath-a-kitchen-sink-inspecting-the-plumbing-connections-1024x684.jpg\" class=\"attachment-large size-large\" alt=\"A 2nd Wind plumber underneath a kitchen sink, inspecting the plumbing connections in Columbia, SC\" srcset=\"/images/2024/03/A-Carolina-Heating-Service-underneath-a-kitchen-sink-inspecting-the-plumbing-connections-1024x684.jpg 1024w, /images/2024/03/A-Carolina-Heating-Service-underneath-a-kitchen-sink-inspecting-the-plumbing-connections-300x200.jpg 300w, /images/2024/03/A-Carolina-Heating-Service-underneath-a-kitchen-sink-inspecting-the-plumbing-connections-768x513.jpg 768w, /images/2024/03/A-Carolina-Heating-Service-underneath-a-kitchen-sink-inspecting-the-plumbing-connections-1536x1026.jpg 1536w, /images/2024/03/A-Carolina-Heating-Service-underneath-a-kitchen-sink-inspecting-the-plumbing-connections.jpg 1916w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) 100vw, 640px\" /></figure>\n<div class=\"our-promise__info\">\n    <p class=\"h3 our-promise__info__headline\">Reliable Plumbing Solutions for Your Home</p>\n    <div class=\"our-promise__info__description\">At 2nd Wind HVAC, we provide comprehensive plumbing services that cover everything from installations to repairs. Our team is committed to delivering high-quality solutions tailored to your home’s specific plumbing needs. Whether you need help with leak repairs, pipe installations, or water heater services, you can trust our experts to deliver efficient, professional service every time.</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div  class=\"container splitter makes-and-models has-background has-white-background-color\" style=\"--CTX-container-split-size: 0.5\">\n\n<div  class=\"splitter-column splitter-column--left splitter-column--center\">\n    <div class=\"splitter-column-inner splitter-column-inner--contained splitter-column-inner--padded\">\n\n        <div class=\"wp-block-group flow has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n\n<div  class=\"logogrid\" style=\"--count: 14;\">\n    <ul role=\"list\" class=\"logocarousel-list\" style=\"--logo-count:14;\">\n            <li class=\"logogrid-item\">\n            <div class=\"logogrid-wrap\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"167\" src=\"/images/2024/02/amana-vector-logo-300x167.png\" class=\"logogrid-image\" alt=\"Amana Heating &amp; Air Conditioning Logo\" srcset=\"/images/2024/02/amana-vector-logo-300x167.png 300w, /images/20